  "synopsis": [
    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "THE YEAR IS 2030.  YOU WAKE UP IN THE TRUNK OF A CAR ONLY TO GET OUT AND FIND THE WORLD HAD GONE INTO A FULL BLOWN APOCALYPSE.\r\n\r\nYOU COULD TRY AND FIX THE SITUATION, BUT IT'D BE A LOT EASIER TO JUST FIND A BAR AND GRAB A DRINK!\r\n\r\nTOO BAD SOME FOLKS WANNA START SHIT EVEN AS THE WORLD IS ENDING!\r\n\r\nFight your way through 10 Levels of random bars and parking lots worth of assholes that can't just let you chill.  No kicks. No combos. Just good old fashioned, fist in your face mayhem."
    }
